OL,3,GNEWSAStories to make you smile from
OL,4,Aacross Yorkshire
OL,5,
OL,6,FEvery week in Yorkshire, we cover
OL,7,Fuplifting and feel-good stories across
OL,8,Four region - and we like to shout about
OL,9,Fthem.
OL,11,FThis week, among other stories, we are
OL,12,Ffeaturing a daring dog rescue, a pool
OL,13,Fteam's #10,000 victory and a portrait
OL,14,Fof a chip shop owner which boasts a
OL,15,Fsurprising royal connection.
OL,17,FWhen Dorothy Henry arrived in the UK
OL,18,Ffrom Grenada in the 1950s, she started
OL,19,Fa dynasty - three generations of women
OL,20,Fwho dedicated their lives to NHS
OL,21,Fpatients.
